  "title": "Instant Pot Chicken Bone Broth",
  "description": "Use your Instant Pot and the carcass of a rotisserie chicken to make a delicious and rich chicken bone broth, tasty enough for sipping.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
